eli-engineer: For now we can treat this as support-guidance. If we see >5% of rerank errors coming from object-vs-array, escalate to runtime team to add SDK linters or schema hints. I'll add a short server-side improvement ticket: include error path and example payload in error body.
sara-support: Sent workaround to customer with corrected payload and asked them to upgrade their JSON builder. Marking ticket P2 -> will escalate to P1 if we see recurrence or other customers affected. Closing loop here but leaving thread for follow-ups. :thumbsup:
